WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.027 --> 00:00:06.662
&gt;&gt; WELCOME BACK TO HANNITY.

00:00:06.663 --> 00:00:11.233
I'M JASON FILLING IN FOR SEAN IN

00:00:11.234 --> 00:00:13.202
THIS SPECIAL "HANNITY: SOCIALISM

00:00:13.203 --> 00:00:13.569
RISING".

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:15.337
AFTER THE PRESIDENT TOOK A HARD

00:00:15.338 --> 00:00:17.973
LINE STANCE ON THURSDAY, HE

00:00:17.974 --> 00:00:21.076
CALLED ON HANNITY AT THE

00:00:21.077 --> 00:00:23.111
POST-SUMMIT PRESS CONFERENCE.

00:00:23.112 --> 00:00:25.714
SEAN ASKED THE PRESIDENT A

00:00:25.715 --> 00:00:31.420
TIMELY QUESTION ABOUT HIS SUMMIT

00:00:31.421 --> 00:00:37.459
WITH KIM JONG-UN.

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:38.493
LET'S WATCH.

00:00:38.494 --> 00:00:41.463
&gt;&gt; A LOT OF CONDEMNATION AT THE

00:00:41.464 --> 00:00:41.897
TIME.

00:00:41.898 --> 00:00:44.399
AND IT ENDED UP WORKING OUT VERY

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:47.502
WELL IN THE END FOR THE UNITED

00:00:47.503 --> 00:00:47.836
STATES.

00:00:47.837 --> 00:00:49.638
WAS THIS MOSTLY YOUR DECISION,

00:00:49.639 --> 00:00:52.274
AND WHAT MESSAGE WOULD YOU WANT

00:00:52.275 --> 00:00:54.576
TO SEND CHAIRMAN KIM AS HE'S

00:00:54.577 --> 00:00:55.510
LISTENING TO THIS PRESS

00:00:55.511 --> 00:00:56.578
CONFERENCE ABOUT THE FUTURE AND

00:00:56.579 --> 00:00:57.779
YOUR RELATIONSHIP?

00:00:57.780 --> 00:00:59.581
&gt;&gt; WELL, SEAN, I DON'T WANT TO

00:00:59.582 --> 00:01:02.384
SAY IT WAS MY DECISION BECAUSE

00:01:02.385 --> 00:01:04.219
WHAT PURPOSE IS THAT?

00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:05.787
I WANT TO KEEP THE RELATIONSHIP

00:01:05.788 --> 00:01:07.689
AND WE WILL KEEP THE

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:08.190
RELATIONSHIP.

00:01:08.191 --> 00:01:10.058
WE'LL SEE WHAT HAPPENS OVER THE

00:01:10.059 --> 00:01:10.626
NEXT PERIOD OF TIME.

00:01:10.627 --> 00:01:13.595
BUT AS YOU KNOW, WE GOT OUR

00:01:13.596 --> 00:01:16.565
HOSTAGES BACK, THERE'S NO MORE

00:01:16.566 --> 00:01:17.199
TESTING.

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:18.834
AND ONE OF THE THINGS

00:01:18.835 --> 00:01:20.802
IMPORTANTLY THAT HE PROMISED ME

00:01:20.803 --> 00:01:22.437
LAST NIGHT IS REGARDLESS, HE'S

00:01:22.438 --> 00:01:24.740
NOT GOING TO DO TESTING OF

00:01:24.741 --> 00:01:26.341
ROCKETS AND NUCLEAR, NOT GOING

00:01:26.342 --> 00:01:27.776
TO DO TESTING.

00:01:27.777 --> 00:01:30.078
I TRUST HIM AND I TAKE HIM AT

00:01:30.079 --> 00:01:30.812
HIS WORD.

00:01:30.813 --> 00:01:32.080
I HOPE THAT'S TRUE.

00:01:32.081 --> 00:01:35.150
BUT IN THE MEANTIME, WE'LL BE

00:01:35.151 --> 00:01:35.484
TALKING.

00:01:35.485 --> 00:01:37.185
MIKE WILL BE SPEAKING WITH HIS

00:01:37.186 --> 00:01:37.519
PEOPLE.

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:39.621
HE'S ALSO DEVELOPED A VERY GOOD

00:01:39.622 --> 00:01:41.356
RELATIONSHIP WITH THE PEOPLE,

00:01:41.357 --> 00:01:43.158
REALLY THE PEOPLE REPRESENTING

00:01:43.159 --> 00:01:45.427
NORTH KOREA.

00:01:45.428 --> 00:01:49.431
I HAVEN'T SPOKEN TO PRESIDENT

00:01:49.432 --> 00:01:49.965
MOON, SOUTH KOREA.

00:01:49.966 --> 00:01:50.932
BUT WE WILL.

00:01:50.933 --> 00:01:53.135
AND WE'LL TELL THEM IT'S A

00:01:53.136 --> 00:01:54.770
PROCESS, THAT IT'S MOVING ALONG,

00:01:54.771 --> 00:01:57.539
BUT WE JUST FELT THAT IT WASN'T

00:01:57.540 --> 00:01:58.674
APPROPRIATE TO SIGN AN AGREEMENT

00:01:58.675 --> 00:01:58.974
TODAY.

00:01:58.975 --> 00:01:59.641
WE COULD HAVE.

00:01:59.642 --> 00:02:02.277
I JUST FELT IT WASN'T VERY

00:02:02.278 --> 00:02:02.678
APPROPRIATE.

00:02:02.679 --> 00:02:04.079
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU FOR WATCHING

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:04.479
TONIGHT.

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:05.714
THANKS TO SEAN HANNITY FOR

00:02:05.715 --> 00:02:10.286
LETTING ME GUEST HOST TONIGHT.

